# The settings' memory: a setting changed (here the key change on the SETTINGS page: HOME held) is kept in flash a moment after, and is back at the next power-on;
# a setting of an effect too (the Flex page's quantize: SEL + FX walks to the last pages).
seed 0
wait 3000
press HOME
wait 900
release HOME
wait 100
expect fxpage 18
spin K1 2
spin K2 1
wait 3500
expect keyset 2
reboot
wait 4000
expect keyset 2
expect saver 1
